{"unit_id":"FuSheng-cs__Trae2api-dsh#card-zh","repo":"FuSheng-cs/Trae2api-dsh","commit":"7750117025c1f76b9db8f590479242a8dddc78a4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Trae2api-dsh 是面向 DSH 网页与桌面端的 TRAE CN 模型接入插件。它将 TRAE 账号发现的模型注册为 DSH 原生模型供应商，并提供内嵌控制台。用户可以导入或切换账号、刷新模型目录、选择模型显示状态，并把模型接入对话菜单；服务由插件管理，使用前需有 TRAE CN 或 TRAE SOLO CN 账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-34","index.js:188-215","python/model_catalog.py:30-68"]}
{"unit_id":"FuSheng-cs__Trae2api-dsh#card-en","repo":"FuSheng-cs/Trae2api-dsh","commit":"7750117025c1f76b9db8f590479242a8dddc78a4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Trae2api-dsh connects TRAE CN models to DSH web and desktop. It registers discovered models as a provider and adds an embedded console. Users can import or switch accounts, refresh the catalog, control model visibility, and connect models to DSH chat. A TRAE CN or TRAE SOLO CN account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-34","index.js:188-215","python/model_catalog.py:30-68"]}
