{"unit_id":"FuSheng-cs__Trae2api-dsh#feature-1","repo":"FuSheng-cs/Trae2api-dsh","commit":"7750117025c1f76b9db8f590479242a8dddc78a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Trae2api-dsh 的功能「TRAE 模型目录」：插件从当前 TRAE 账号发现可用模型及其上下文、输出上限和思考档位，并在 DSH 模型管理中展示。用户可手动刷新目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["python/model_catalog.py:30-68","index.js:202-203"]}
{"unit_id":"FuSheng-cs__Trae2api-dsh#feature-2","repo":"FuSheng-cs/Trae2api-dsh","commit":"7750117025c1f76b9db8f590479242a8dddc78a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Trae2api-dsh 的功能「账号与模型接入」：用户可导入或切换 TRAE 账号；服务运行后连接操作会把可见模型配置为 DSH 原生供应商，断开时移除该供应商配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:145-180","index.js:209-215"]}
{"unit_id":"FuSheng-cs__Trae2api-dsh#feature-3","repo":"FuSheng-cs/Trae2api-dsh","commit":"7750117025c1f76b9db8f590479242a8dddc78a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Trae2api-dsh 的功能「模型显示管理」：用户可搜索模型并逐个或批量显示、隐藏；配置变更后，已连接时同步更新 DSH 模型列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:48-83","index.js:204-208"]}
